    "body": "Leader ruling (recorded by governance): eng-sor2 found a leftover SOR-05 defect. The `soroi_eval` tool parameter schema has a `z.union` at the top level, so the model provider returns 400 on the very first request (\"schema must be a JSON Schema of type object\"). eng-sor2 fixes this first, in its own new issue + PR: the wire schema's top level becomes `type: object`, domain validation stays unchanged, and every plugin tool schema is checked. Then eng-sor2 returns to SOR-09 (#196).",
